uktur, wenn ich es dir nach jeder Änderung blinkend präsentieren soll, ist das jedesmal der 4fache Aufwand.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Passt die Schriftart, Position, Größe, die Farbe &amp;alles andere?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":16344,"threadID":1724,"userID":262,"username":"Deagletrix","subject":"","time":1404906548,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><strong>Jo passt</strong> </p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[adminking]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":16351,"threadID":1724,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","subject":"","time":1404910060,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Welche Farben, welches spricht dir mehr zu? Die weißen Umrandungen sind nur im Thema zu sehen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span> </p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span> </p>\n<p><br></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":16363,"threadID":1724,"userID":262,"username":"Deagletrix","subject":"","time":1404922699,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Beide sind geil</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[adminking]</span></p>","polls":[]}]}